7592186045417] [17592186500528 #edb/ref 1080 "43\\,200{\\text{ cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500528 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500528 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1d66b81f-aab7-5dee-bc76-93149d565137" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500678 #edb/ref 1080 "44\\,100{\\text{ cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500678 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500678 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "651e5094-ed0f-5287-afa0-88760a288cd1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500700 #edb/ref 1080 "40\\,150{\\text{ cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500700 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500700 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "70ef183c-3e32-589d-bdef-3a17eb486140" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500876 #edb/ref 1080 "41\\,200{\\text{ cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500876 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186500876 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c387d300-dcb3-5156-be2d-bccac09b58bc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186500498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186500528 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186500678 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186500700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186500876 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186500528 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501066 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7049e9d7-8f84-594a-912b-f5fcab69cbfa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186501066 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1069 "q-30081" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/ea/ea7c818a6694ba959c5230dcde8611a7b1dc44bcad383f54c93d2934336c35b6.png)\n\nThe edges of a cube decrease at a rate of $9\\text{ cm/s}.$ At what rate is the volume decreasing when the length of each edge is $40\\text{ cm}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2d8efcf9-a827-5e33-8982-8c950b1390fe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501156 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $x$ be the side length of the cube and let $V$ be its volume. We are given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}=-9\\text{ cm/s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe would like to find $\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}$ when $x=40\\text{ cm}.$\n\nWe start with the formula for the volume of the cube:\n\n$$\nV={x}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate with respect to time using the chain rule, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(V) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({x}^{3}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =3{x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plug $x=40$ and $\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}=-9\\text{ cm/s}$ into the expression for $\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =3{x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =3(40)^{2}\\cdot (-9)\\, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =-43\\,200.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the cube is decreasing at a rate of $43\\,200{\\text{ cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}$ at the moment when $x=40\\,\\text{cm}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522097 #edb/ref 1080 "9{\\text{ feet}}^{2}/\\text{min}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522097 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522097 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "22f79d57-7057-5d04-9cfc-2b04e2a421f1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522106 #edb/ref 1080 "35\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}/\\text{min}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522106 #edb/